<title>JAPAN: Aug Japan crude oil imports up - MITI statistics.</title>
<headline>Aug Japan crude oil imports up - MITI statistics.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of International Trade and Industry's crude oil import data for August 1996:</p>
<p>CRUDE OIL    (In 1,000 kl) (1,000 bbl) mth/mth%   yr/yr%</p>
<p>Iran	   2,142	 13,473    +137.6  +13.4</p>
<p>Saudi Arabia 5,039	 31,695    +47.8   +14.0</p>
<p>Kuwait	 1,263	  7,944    +24.8   +21.9</p>
<p>Neutral Zone 1,041	  6,548     -2.7   -20.4</p>
<p>Qatar	  1,771	 11,140    +48.3   +34.4</p>
<p>Oman	   1,645	 10,347    +76.5    +7.6</p>
<p>UAE	    6,571	 41,332    +20.4   +17.7</p>
<p>Yemen	    138	    868	+1.6    ---</p>
</text>
